From: TechLuddite <techluddite@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] AYN: enable the internal microphone on Odin 2 Portal

The Portal uses DMIC3 through SWR_MIC7. Keep the capture profile specific
to this board, which shares its sound-card name with the other Odin 2s.

The route was informed by Luke Johnson's Pocknix Thor microphone work.
---
 ucm2/AYN/Odin2/HiFi.conf | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ucm2/AYN/Odin2/HiFi.conf b/ucm2/AYN/Odin2/HiFi.conf
--- a/ucm2/AYN/Odin2/HiFi.conf
+++ b/ucm2/AYN/Odin2/HiFi.conf
@@ -89,3 +89,14 @@ SectionDevice."DisplayPort" {
 		JackHWMute "Speaker"
 	}
 }
+
+If.portal {
+	Condition {
+		Type String
+		String1 "${sys:firmware/devicetree/base/model}"
+		String2 "AYN Odin 2 Portal"
+	}
+	True {
+		Include.mic.File "/AYN/Odin2/PortalMic.conf"
+	}
+}
